cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use APS in research or teaching, cite this repository and identify the commit or recorded evidence revision you used."
type: software
title: "Agentic Process Safety (APS)"
authors:
  - name: "SafetyMP"
    website: "https://github.com/SafetyMP"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SafetyMP/Agentic-Process-Safety"
url: "https://safetymp.github.io/Agentic-Process-Safety/"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An interactive supply chain business case following purchase request REQ-218
  from finance approval to Thursday’s assembly run. Readers use a HAZOP worksheet,
  test when a purchasing agent should release or hold the order, and weigh buyer
  time and material availability in a pilot decision. A technical workspace
  compares the selected request with recorded synthetic trials from the separate
  Python and Open Policy Agent research implementation.
keywords:
  - agentic process safety
  - multi-agent systems
  - hazard analysis
  - HAZOP
  - agent governance
  - human reasoning
  - supply chain
  - procurement
  - business case
